 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 3.97,
   "end": 5.45,
   "text": "Three friends, one deadline."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.2,
   "end": 8.88,
   "text": "The pizza is twenty-five minutes out, and they want a"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.63,
   "end": 10.7,
   "text": "game before it lands."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.45,
   "end": 13.74,
   "text": "Talk2Build sits in the meeting, with Alexa plus as its voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.04,
   "end": 18.47,
   "text": "Maya says the goal out loud."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.22,
   "end": 19.28,
   "text": "Nobody types a command."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.03,
   "end": 22.89,
   "text": "A plan card appears, and the decision and action items"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.64,
   "end": 24.07,
   "text": "are saved under her name."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.07,
   "end": 28.54,
   "text": "Chris sketches the architecture."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.29,
   "end": 30.69,
   "text": "Priya asks for the game screen."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.44,
   "end": 33.94,
   "text": "Both land on the shared stage while they are still talking."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.1,
   "end": 42.98,
   "text": "Then the classic argument: Phaser or PixiJS?"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.73,
   "end": 44.59,
   "text": "This card is live."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.34,
   "end": 48.9,
   "text": "Real GitHub and npm numbers, each with its source."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.65,
   "end": 49.58,
   "text": "Talk2Build recommends."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.33,
   "end": 53.23,
   "text": "The humans decide: plain canvas, zero dependencies."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.14,
   "end": 59.95,
   "text": "Is the pizza here yet?"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.7,
   "end": 60.84,
   "text": "Small talk gets parked."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.59,
   "end": 62.35,
   "text": "It stays out of the plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.67,
   "end": 68.33,
   "text": "A feasibility card for phones: plain canvas works, as"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.08,
   "end": 69.5,
   "text": "long as it gets touch controls."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.2,
   "end": 74.18,
   "text": "Chris asks for the build."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.93,
   "end": 77.22,
   "text": "Anything that writes code waits for a human yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.97,
   "end": 78.5,
   "text": "Maya says yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.25,
   "end": 80.81,
   "text": "Talk2Build writes a spec from the meeting's decisions,"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.56,
   "end": 84.46,
   "text": "scaffolds the prototype from its game-jam template, and"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.21,
   "end": 86.17,
   "text": "runs the tests."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.92,
   "end": 86.95,
   "text": "Seven of seven pass."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.24,
   "end": 94.49,
   "text": "And here it is, playable right inside the meeting."
  },
  {
   "start": 94.24,
   "end": 95.37,
   "text": "Space Cat Courier."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.12,
   "end": 98.4,
   "text": "Dodge the asteroids, grab pizza for fuel."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.15,
   "end": 101.17,
   "text": "Every ten parcels, the asteroids speed up."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.27,
   "end": 115.09,
   "text": "Then the real pizza arrived."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.84,
   "end": 115.86,
   "text": "Parked, naturally."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.3,
   "end": 120.07,
   "text": "End the meeting."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.82,
   "end": 123.15,
   "text": "The minutes, the spec, the designs and the prototype"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.9,
   "end": 124.03,
   "text": "stay in the workspace."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.44,
   "end": 132.03,
   "text": "Under the hood, Alexa plus talks to a self-hosted MCP"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.78,
   "end": 136.02,
   "text": "server over Streamable HTTP, and the tools do the work."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.77,
   "end": 139.73,
   "text": "This demo runs in mock mode, on recorded fixtures."
  }
 ]
}